sentences.text:
In the result, the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed in part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 16.08.2019 passed in MVC No.5452/2017 by the Court of Small Causes and Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, X Additional Judge Court of Small Causes (SCCH-16), Bangalore, is modified to an extent stated herein.

iii) The claimant is entitled for enhanced compensation of Rs.52,078/- with interest at the rate of 7%
p.a. from the date of petition till its realisation in addition to the compensation awarded by the Tribunal;
iv) Respondent No.1 - insurer shall deposit the said compensation together with accrued interest within a period of six weeks;
v) Upon such deposit, the entire enhanced compensation together with interest accrued thereupon be disbursed digitally to the claimant;
vi) The Registry to draw the modified award accordingly;
vii) Records of the Tribunal be transmitted to the Tribunal forthwith.
No costs.

